### Invoices — Homebase API
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@tenancyId = 0192f58e-4a61-7bf0-8e6f-47dc2e0f49f7
@propertyId = 0192f58e-4a61-7bf0-8e6f-47dc2e0f49f5
@invoiceId = 0192f58e-4a61-7bf0-8e6f-47dc2e0f49f9

### 1. Generate Invoices for Current Month (all active tenancies)
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 2. Generate Invoices for a Specific Month
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2026,
  "month": 9
}

### 3. Generate Invoices for a Specific Tenancy
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenancyId": "{{tenancyId}}",
  "year": 2026,
  "month": 9
}

### 4. Generate Invoices for a Property
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}",
  "year": 2026,
  "month": 9
}

### 5. Get All Invoices (with Pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?page=1&limit=10

### 6. Get Invoices Filtered by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?status=UNPAID

### 7. Get Invoices for a Tenancy
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?tenancyId={{tenancyId}}

### 8. Get Invoices for a Property
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?propertyId={{propertyId}}

### 9. Get Invoice Details (with line items & payments)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}

### 9a. Get Invoice Summary (Money tab tiles, all properties)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/summary

### 9b. Get Invoice Summary for a Single Property
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/summary?propertyId={{propertyId}}

### 10. Update Invoice (e.g. due date)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dueDate": "2026-09-10T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### 11. Refresh Invoice (append new meter readings in period)
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/refresh